WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.880
Main D S H already offers local application ports and

00:00:03.880 --> 00:00:07.280
approved external H T T P S targets. The visitor

00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:10.760
access selector offers Require D S H sign in and

00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:16.180
Public access. Authenticated sharing and destination permissions are separate. RegChat

00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:20.220
is a configured example, rather than a special login mechanism.

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:23.440
Use the Main settings page and the approved application links

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:26.640
supplied by your operator. Opening a saved link does not

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:30.520
create a mapping, start an application, or change its permissions.

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:34.870
Main and Test serve different purposes. The gated and Public

00:00:34.870 --> 00:00:38.480
RegChat examples are available through Main. App Five and App

00:00:38.480 --> 00:00:42.480
Six are controlled Test examples. App Five requires a normal

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:45.393
D S H session. Sign in through normal D S

00:00:45.393 --> 00:00:49.160
H, then return to the original application tab. That tab

00:00:49.160 --> 00:00:53.400
resumes its original application path. App Six uses Public routing,

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:57.060
but the destination can still require its own login. Public

00:00:57.060 --> 00:01:00.960
access does not open a workspace, notebook, terminal, or chat

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:01.800
history.

00:01:01.800 --> 00:01:04.400
A fresh D S H logout and sign in check

00:01:04.400 --> 00:01:07.540
returned App Five to the correct original path and restored

00:01:07.540 --> 00:01:11.680
normal No Internet sign in. Its separate destination session remained

00:01:11.680 --> 00:01:15.860
intact. App Six protected content rejected access before its own

00:01:15.860 --> 00:01:19.480
login, then opened without a D S H cookie. That

00:01:19.480 --> 00:01:23.060
Public session could not bypass App Five. The latest full

00:01:23.060 --> 00:01:26.720
English course is hosted in the Test documentation library. This

00:01:26.720 --> 00:01:30.700
identifies where the media is hosted. Main application controls are

00:01:30.700 --> 00:01:34.320
already live. The earlier course chapters remain available.
